    "body": "This conflicts with main and needs the author's judgement: `crates/app/src/posting_index_swing.rs` - main's #818 rewrote the work-A verdict shape (named-field `Judged { letter, line, nose, stacked }`, a `Nose` reason enum, a reworked `work_a`), while the branch carries the pre-#818 tuple form and its own `work_a`. Please `git merge upstream/main` and re-implement your clause on main's new shape - keep both laws, drop neither - then push. Note main moved again since the draft flip (now d7e9a807, PROCESS_VERSION 29).\n",
